      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……美兔原本没有朋友。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1050",
      "BgmFileName": "11",
      "VoiceFileName": "10404090010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040409002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040409,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "就算想和别人聊天，也没有勇气主动开口……/n可即便别人来搭话，又总是没办法好好回应……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10404090020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040409003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040409,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……除了家以外，没有属于自己的容身之处。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10404090030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040409004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040409,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可是……伊吕波亲却和这样的美兔成为了朋友。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10404090040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040409005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040409,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "她会帮美兔想适合的发型和衣服，也会一起Cosplay……/n就连加入电姬的契机，果然也是伊吕波亲。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10404090050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040409006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040409,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "进入剧团，第一次开始演戏之后，/n被别人夸奖、让别人开心的机会也越来越多……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10404090060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040409007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040409,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "美兔现在能这么快乐，/n全都、全都是因为伊吕波亲。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10404090070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
